### ============================
### Dashboard auth (company manager)
### ============================
### Register company manager (dashboard auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Demo Transit Company&email=demo%40company.com&password=123456

### Login company manager (dashboard auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=demo%40company.com&password=123456

### Logout company manager
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### ============================
### Mobile app REST (Flutter)
### Base paths:
### - /api/mobile/auth/*
### - /api/mobile/profile
### - /api/mobile/wallet/*
### ============================

### Mobile signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/auth/signup
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "name": "{{mobileName}}",
  "phone": "{{mobilePhone}}",
  "password": "{{mobilePassword}}"
}

### Mobile login (captures tokens in response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "phone": "{{mobilePhone}}",
  "password": "{{mobilePassword}}"
}

### Mobile profile (requires access token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Add credit (requires access token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/wallet/add-credit
Content-Type: {{json}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "amount": 100
}

### Get /wallet/deduct-price
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/wallet/deduct-price
Content-Type: {{json}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Get credit balance (requires access token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/wallet/balance
Content-Type: {{json}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Deduct credit for bus payment (requires access token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/wallet/deduct
Content-Type: {{json}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "busId": "{{busId}}"
}

### GET all routes for all companies (requires access token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/routes
Content-Type: {{json}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================
### Choose routes + live bus info (public)
### ============================

### Public routes list (all companies)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/public/routes

### Public routes list by company
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/public/routes?companyId={{companyId}}

### Public active buses for a route (choose a route → show buses)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/public/routes/{{routeId}}/buses

### Public nearest active bus for a route (map pin near bus)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/public/routes/{{routeId}}/nearest?latitude=36.1999&longitude=37.1499

### ============================
### Live map (SSE)
### ============================
# NOTE: Current backend SSE is protected by manager session auth (not mobile JWT).
# Endpoint exists at: /api/realtime/sse
# Use dashboard login to get your session cookie, then add it manually here.

### Live map stream (SSE) - requires dashboard session cookie (not JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/realtime/sse
# Cookie: session=<PUT_SESSION_COOKIE_HERE>

### ============================
### Hardware ingestion (no mobile auth)
### ============================
### Create route from dashboard API (requires authenticated session cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/routes
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "routeName": "Line 10 - Downtown",
  "coordinates": [
    [37.1481231, 36.1984372],
    [37.1582011, 36.2100000],
    [37.1703333, 36.2208888]
  ]
}

### Ingest location from hardware (no auth for now, stores data only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hardware/location
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "apiSecret": "{{companyApiSecret}}",
  "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}",
  "busNumber": "BUS-12",
  "routeId": "{{routeId}}",
  "latitude": 36.1984372,
  "longitude": 37.1481231,
  "speed": 42,
  "timestamp": "2026-04-14T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### Ingest + send summary to Telegram (no auth for now, this is the request that should message the bot)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test/telegram
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "apiSecret": "{{companyApiSecret}}",
  "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}",
  "busNumber": "BUS-12",
